# ASR pipeline

Whisper is not a native streaming model. Low latency = short overlapping windows + a resident CUDA model.

- Capture: WASAPI via PyAudio, 16 kHz mono, ~20 ms frames, lock-free ring buffer.
- Windows: ~2.0 s audio, 250 ms hop. `condition_on_previous_text=False`. Stitch overlapping windows; commit only on `.` `?` `!`.
- Model: `large-v3-turbo` (`turbo`), `device="cuda"`, `compute_type="float16"`.
- `beam_size=1` on partials. Partials → overlay only. Whole-phrase voice commands (`paste last`, `copy last`, `correct last`) skip Ollama.
- Enable OFF must stop the PortAudio stream and idle the ASR worker.
- Voice gate (RMS + spectral centroid) skips ASR on silence and other speakers. Capture stays running while Listen is ON.
- Also gate on `no_speech_prob` and avg logprob. Do not overwrite clipboard on reject. No pyannote on the hot path.
- VAD is a chunk-boundary / confidence hint only — never a reason to skip capture while enable is ON.
